NightSharp Comprehensive Update Plan
=====================================

Dependency Map: Core -> SDK
  Offsets.generated.h / Offsets.h
    -> core/CoreSpellBook.h  -> sdk/Core/Objects.h, sdk/Wrappers/Spells/Spell.h, sdk/Events/SpellCastTracker.h
    -> core/CoreBuffs.h      -> sdk/Core/Objects.h, sdk/Wrappers/Orbwalking/, sdk/Math/HealthPrediction.h
    -> core/CoreAi.h         -> sdk/Core/Objects.h, sdk/Math/Prediction/Movement.h
    -> core/CoreEventHook.h  -> sdk/Events/SpellCastTracker.h, sdk/Events/PropertyTracker.h
    -> core/CoreObjects.h    -> sdk/Core/Objects.h, sdk/GameObjects/
    -> core/CoreControl.h    -> sdk/Core/Objects.h, sdk/Wrappers/Orbwalking/

