[x] 1.1 Return Address Spoofing cho ALL hooks (9/9)
    Files: core/CoreEventHook.h, core/spoof/spoofcall.h
    - All 9 hooks use spoof_call when calling original
    - Hooks: OnProcessSpell, OnStopCast, OnFinishCast, OnBuffAdd,
      OnSpellImpact, OnCreateObject, OnGameUpdate,
      OnHeroActionStateChange, OnMinionFollowChange
    - Each has: typedef, callback, detour, install, spoof_call, uninstall
    SDK impact: Khong - SDK goi qua CoreAPI, transparent

