========================================================================
PHASE 2: Offset Synchronization (Offset -> NightSharp)
========================================================================

[x] 2.1 Offset sync toan bo (Offsets.generated.h + Offsets.h)

    SpellSlot updates:
    [x] Level RESOLVED: 0x1C=getter (sub_2993D0), 0x28=LevelAlt (LevelUp sub_36DB50)
        NightSharp SlotLevel now = 0x1C (official getter), SlotLevelAlt = 0x28
    [x] ActiveSpellCast = 0x118 (new - per-slot cast ptr, NULL=not casting, IDA sub_9DA130)
    [x] Cooldown = 0x80, TotalCd = 0x88 (match)
    [x] ChargeTimer = 0x30 (new - charge/ammo recharge timer)
    [x] CooldownExpires = 0x70 (new - game time expiry, -1=off CD)
    [x] Stacks = 0x5C (match)
    [x] SpellNameHash = 0x110 (new - FNV hash)
    [x] SpellInstanceVars = 0x108 (new)
    [x] SpellNameStr = 0x28, SpellNameCap = 0x40 (new - in SpellDataResource)
    SpellCastInfo fix:
    [x] TargetIndex: 0x108 -> 0x9C (IDA verified: MissileClient cross-ref 0x35C-0x2C0=0x9C)
        0x108 was container/array object, NOT target NetId
        Diagnostics shows both old/new for live verification

    Function addresses updated:
    [x] CreateClientEffect: 0x84B710 -> 0x83C1F0
    [x] GetSpellSlot: 0x91E2D0 -> 0x91E540

    BuffManager:
    [x] Array 1 (+0x18/+0x20, stride=16) - NightSharp dung dung
    [x] Array 2 (+0x620/+0x628, stride=8) - them vao generated.h lam alternative

    17 new namespaces added to Offsets.generated.h:
    [x] GadgetRuntime        - ThreadTrampoline, JMP[rbx] gadgets
    [x] DirectInputRuntime   - KB/Mouse device, buffer, count, vtable
    [x] ZoomRuntime           - Camera chain, zoom config min/max
    [x] SkinRuntime           - SkinNetID, SkinName, ModelName
    [x] ShopRuntime           - IsShopOpen = 0x1DBBF98
    [x] EventSpellCastInfoLayout - SCI_CasterNetId, SpellSlotInt, IsStopCast
    [x] NavGridCellLayout     - Cell structure 16B, CELL_WALL/BRUSH/WATER flags
    [x] CombatStatsLayout     - 20 combat stat offsets
    [x] HeroFieldsLayout      - Gold, Exp, Level, InputLocks, VisionScore
    [x] MinionFieldsLayout    - FollowTargetNetId, barracks mods
    [x] TurretFieldsLayout    - PropertyManager, PalisadesCount
    [x] AIBaseFieldsLayout    - Lifetime, IsTargetable, MoveSpeed
    [x] ObjectFieldsLayout    - Core obj fields (Index, Name, Team, Position)
    [x] SpellDataParamLayout  - Parameter indices (castrange, missilespeed, etc)
    [x] MissileSpellCastInfoLayout - Missile cast info (entry 0x190 bytes)
    [x] AiManagerNavDataLayout - Full navdata: velocity, dash target, arrived flag
    [x] TargetRuntime         - AITargetComponent = 0x1498

    Compatibility layer (Offsets.h) updated:
    [x] SpellBook: +6 new slot fields + SpellNameStr/Cap
    [x] New namespaces: Shop, Zoom, Skin, Gadget, DInput, NavGridCell, EventSCI, AiManagerNavData

[ ] 2.2 NavGrid flags reconcile
    Conflict: NightSharp WALL=0x1, BRUSH=0xC00 vs Offset WALL=0x02, BRUSH=0x04
    NavGridCellLayout da them voi gia tri tu Offset ref (IDA verified)
    NavGridFlags (old) van giu nguyen - can verify CE de quyet dinh dung cai nao
    SDK impact: sdk/Math/Prediction/ collision checks

