PHASE 3: Core + SDK Layer Updates
========================================================================

[x] 3.1 core/CoreSpellBook.h - SlotRef updates (DONE)
    - GetLevelAlt(), GetChargeTimer(), GetCooldownExpires()
    - GetSpellNameHash(), GetSpellInstanceVars()
    - GetSlotActiveSpellCast(), IsSlotCasting()
    - ReadSpellNameFromResource() (SpellDataResource SSO path)

[x] 3.2 core/CoreAi.h - New accessors (DONE)
    - HasArrived(), GetDashTargetNetId(), GetDashSecondaryNetId()
    - GetDashDuration(), GetDashDistRemaining()

[x] 3.3 core/CoreObjects.h - ObjectRef updates (DONE)
    - HasArrived(), GetDashTargetNetId(), GetDashDuration(), GetDashDistRemaining()
    - GetGold(), GetGoldTotal(), GetExp()
    - Classification: RuntimeAPI -> CoreClassification (name-based)
    - Added: IsWard, IsInhibitor, IsNexus, IsStructure, ShouldIgnore, IsAttackableBy
    - GetObjectType() returns CoreClassification::ObjectType enum

[x] 3.4 core/CoreClassification.h (NEW - 200+ lines)
    - 17 ObjectTypes: Hero, LaneMinion, JungleMonster, JungleBig, JungleEpic,
      Turret, Inhibitor, Nexus, Ward, Plant, Pet, Scuttle, TurretBuildup,
      Shop, Marker, Spawn, PracticeDummy, Unknown
    - Filters 15+ non-attackable objects (TurretBuildup, Corpse, Seed,
      GenericUnit, HiddenMinion, PlantMasterMinion, etc.)
    - IsAttackable(obj, myTeam), ShouldIgnore(obj), IsStructure(obj)
    - TypeName() for diagnostics

[x] 3.5 sdk/Core/Objects.h - SDK wrapper (DONE)
    - Replace RuntimeAPI:: direct calls -> m_ref. delegation (CoreClassification)
    - Added: IsWard, IsInhibitor, IsNexus, IsStructure, ShouldIgnore

[x] 3.6 plugins/core/OrbwalkerPlugin.h - Orbwalker fixes (DONE)
    - GetStructure(): enabled Inhibitor + Nexus targeting (raw EnumerateMinions + classification)
    - GetStructure(): hp<=0 check for destroyed buildings
    - GetJungle(): ShouldIgnore + classification guard (filter HiddenMinion, Plant, Ward)
    - GetSpecialMinion(): ward filter via CoreClassification (FaeLightWardPad filtered)
    - GetSpecialMinion(): plant uses raw MinionManager (team=3 neutral)
    - GetLastHitMinion(): ShouldIgnore + IsLaneMinion guard
    - GetPushMinion(): ShouldIgnore + IsLaneMinion guard
    - ShouldWait/LastHit/Push damage: restored to GetAutoAttackDamage (original)
    - Menu logic verified: junglePlant=false (correct C# parity)

[x] 3.6b menu/Translations.h - CRT-Free rewrite (DONE)
    - Removed: std::string, std::unordered_map, std::unordered_set
    - Replaced: fixed const LangEntry[] array (90 entries, compile-time)
    - T() uses lstrcmpA linear scan (Win32 API, no CRT)
    - InitTranslations() only loads langIndex from file
    - Root cause of "menu luc len luc khong": STL containers need _initterm

[x] 3.6c PluginManager.h - Singleton fix (reverted)
    - Tested CRT new approach -> caused game crash
    - Reverted to Meyer's singleton (static local)

[x] 3.7 menu/SDKDiagnostics.h - Full verification display (DONE)
    - SpellSlot Q: all new offsets (Level/LevelAlt, 4 CD fields, SpellNameHash,
      ActiveSpellCast, SpellNameFromResource SSO)
    - W/E/R compact summary
    - Active SpellCast: TargetIndex 0x9C vs 0x108 comparison
    - AiManager: dashTgtNetId, dashDuration, dashDistRem, arrived
    - Hero Fields: gold, exp, level, champHash
    - Shop state, Event hook status (9 hooks ON/off)
    - Classification: nearby objects with Type/Attackable/Ignore color-coded

[ ] 3.8 sdk/Wrappers/Spells/Spell.h - Spell system
    - SpellNameHash lookup: nhanh hon string compare
    - Charged spell logic: dung ChargeTimer thay vi buff-check

[ ] 3.9 sdk/Wrappers/Orbwalking/ - Orbwalker improvements
    - Shop state check: them SDK::IsShopOpen() -> khong orbwalk khi shop
    - Event hook: them OnHeroActionStateChange -> detect CC/state changes realtime
    - Minion aggro: them OnMinionFollowTargetNetIdChange hook

[ ] 3.10 sdk/Math/Prediction/Movement.h - Prediction
    - Dash prediction: integrate DashTargetNetId + DashDuration
    - Velocity vectors: su dung VelocityX/Y/Z (0x588-0x590)
    - NavGrid collision: cell-level walkability check
    - Arrived flag: skip prediction neu target da arrived

[ ] 3.11 sdk/Math/HealthPrediction.h
    - Missile tracking accuracy: verify missile net ID offsets match

[ ] 3.12 sdk/Events/SpellCastTracker.h
    - Add OnFinishCast/OnStopCast/OnBuffAdd hooks (core ready, SDK wiring needed)

[ ] 3.13 sdk/Events/PropertyTracker.h
    - OnHeroActionStateChange + OnMinionFollowChange (core ready, SDK wiring needed)

========================================================================
PHASE 4: New Features
========================================================================

[ ] 4.1 ZoomHack (sdk/Features/ZoomHack.h)
    - Camera chain: HudInstance -> +0x18 -> Camera -> +0x3D0 -> ZoomConfig -> +0x24/+0x28
    - Pure memory write - NO trampoline needed
    - Methods: SetZoom(), SetZoomLimits(), PatchZoomLimits() (safest)
    - SDK wrapper: SDK::ZoomHack::SetLimits(min, max)

[ ] 4.2 NavGrid Full API (core/CoreNavGrid.h + sdk/Core/NavGrid.h)
    - Cell-level IsWall/IsBrush/IsWater (su dung NavGridCellLayout)
    - Path collision check
    - World <-> Cell conversion (CellSize, MinX/MinZ, HalfCellSize)

[ ] 4.3 DirectInput (core/CoreInput.h)
    - vtable hook for keyboard/mouse (VT_GetDeviceData = 0x50)
    - Input inject/filter capability
    - Device ptrs: KB=0x1E68BF8, Mouse=0x1E68C00

[ ] 4.4 ModSkin (sdk/Features/ModSkin.h)
    - Read: SkinNetID, SkinName, ModelName, SkinChangeFlag
    - Write: SkinParam1/SkinParam2 (method 1, no trampoline)
    - Full reload: call sub_DA1740 (method 2, NEEDS trampoline)

